# Debian package control file for callwarden-daemon
# Task: T-1783983162956-b2a8

Package: callwarden-daemon
Version: 0.3.0
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Call Warden Team <team@callwarden.dev>
Description: Call Warden Enterprise Daemon
 Enterprise-grade code knowledge graph daemon with UDS,
 SO_PEERCRED ACL, CAS, Replicator, and SnapshotManager.
 .
 Features:
  - UDS server with SO_PEERCRED authentication
  - Content-Addressable Storage (CAS) with GC
  - SnapshotManager with ArcSwap atomic publish
  - Durable staging WAL with crash recovery
  - systemd integration with graceful shutdown
Depends: callwarden-local (= 0.3.0), systemd, libc6 (>= 2.17)
